Comment: fr_BJ is derived from the fr_FR locale of the GNU C Library (copy "fr_FR").
 fon_BJ copies fr_FR and fr_BJ categories and follows the collation scheme of
 the glibc locales (iso14651_t1, as in yo_NG).
 Fon linguistic data (fon_BJ): Hodonou Sounton, Modukpe S., Sedonu S.,
 Ifeshola S.

